C03: the remembered-value check keeps content words, not the whole sentence (MEMORY1255 repair)

MEMORY1253 rejected faithful confirmations that shifted person («mi
cumpleaños» → «tu cumpleaños», «my favorite drink» → «your favorite
drink») and the retry hint made the model print the field name. The
check now requires the content words of the remembered value, untranslated,
and the hint lists only the missing words.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


